images.prompt:
Use case: ads-marketing.
Create ONE finished Chinese Xiaohongshu carousel cover, portrait aspect ratio EXACTLY 3:4, 1536 x 2048 pixels. This is page 1 of a three-page campaign for the open source learning app 微课堂. Entire image is the printable poster, no device frame, no multi-poster montage. Art direction: highly designed playful editorial poster, warm ivory lightly textured paper, very dark forest-green chunky Chinese display typography, restrained vermilion accent; tactile handmade paper-clay miniature illustration with realistic material and soft shadows, charming adult humor rather than childish. Keep large safe margins and much breathing room. Use only the EXACT Chinese words below, all sharp and correctly spelled. The text should occupy the upper half, legible even in a small mobile feed thumbnail:
"我的收藏夹" on first line in forest green;
"已经保研了" on second line in forest green;
"我还没开学" on third line, very large in vermilion.
The lower half visualizes the joke: a very full mustard-yellow anthropomorphic bookmarks folder confidently wearing a graduation cap, stuffed with simple colorful paper tabs; beside it a little round ivory clay human slumped at an empty desk with a closed notebook, baffled but endearing, a tiny question mark drawn above. No screens, no fictitious user interface, no numerical results. Keep silhouettes bold and minimal. Small quiet footer text: "微课堂 · 每次约10分钟". No additional text, no watermark, no platform logo, no website URL. This is an obvious self-deprecating metaphor, not an educational outcome claim. Make it witty and instantly readable, with carefully balanced typography.
